1
00:00:00,020 --> 00:00:03,460
Penny, is it weird that
we're having girls' night here,

2
00:00:03,457 --> 00:00:04,757
(Amy:)but you don't
live here anymore,

3
00:00:04,759 --> 00:00:06,259
(Amy:)so it's basically
my girls' night?

4
00:00:06,260 --> 00:00:07,790
(Penny:)I hadn't really
thought about it.

5
00:00:07,795 --> 00:00:09,725
(Amy:)But now you're thinking about it
and it bothers you?

6
00:00:09,730 --> 00:00:11,500
(Amy:)I get that.

7
00:00:13,434 --> 00:00:16,434
(Bernadette:)Things going well with you
and Sheldon living together?

8
00:00:16,437 --> 00:00:17,707
(Amy:)Better than ever.

9
00:00:17,705 --> 00:00:20,535
(Amy:)He asks about my day,
takes an interest in my life.

10
00:00:20,541 --> 00:00:22,141
(Amy:)He's like my boyfriend
in college,

11
00:00:22,143 --> 00:00:25,043
(Amy:)except he's real,
so people can see him.

12
00:00:27,047 --> 00:00:28,517
(Bernadette:)I've been seeing him for years,

13
00:00:28,516 --> 00:00:30,786
(Bernadette:)I'm still not convinced
he's real.

14
00:00:32,153 --> 00:00:34,153
(Penny:)Hey, can I
ask you a question?

15
00:00:34,155 --> 00:00:35,625
(Penny:)You've been married
for a while.

16
00:00:35,623 --> 00:00:37,053
(Penny:)Is it normal
for the husband

17
00:00:37,057 --> 00:00:40,357
(Penny:)to kind of completely stop
giving a crap?

18
00:00:40,361 --> 00:00:42,891
Uh-oh, what's going on?

19
00:00:42,897 --> 00:00:44,867
(Penny:)Well, Leonard used to
do all these things,

20
00:00:44,865 --> 00:00:46,395
(Penny:)like bring me flowers

21
00:00:46,400 --> 00:00:49,000
(Penny:)and wear pants.

22
00:00:49,003 --> 00:00:52,073
(Bernadette:)It's okay,
Howie never has on pants.

23
00:00:52,072 --> 00:00:55,812
(Bernadette:)The Domino's guy brings
the pizza like this now.

